      "reasoning": "WOW! This is MY TURN 6! Cloudshift created 2 token copies of Inspiring Overseer (0/1 illusions) via Preston's ability! They triggered, gained my opponent life, and drew them cards. My opponent went from 25 to 29 life (gained 4), and now has 7 cards in hand (library down to 22).\n\
