- I have Renegade Demon (5/3) which can attack next turn\n\
- I have Reaper from the Abyss (6/6 flyer for 3BBB) which can destroy non-Demons if creatures died\n\
- I have Disciple of Perdition (1/3 for {1}{B})\n\
- I have Demon's Grasp ({4}{B} -5/-5)\n\
\n\
**Best play:** Cast Disciple of Perdition now to set up sacrifice later. Then next turn, attack with Renegade Demon. This will kill something (Renegade Demon or one of their creatures), triggering Reaper's morbid.\n\
\n\
Actually wait - let me reconsider. My Renegade Demon is no longer summoning sick! I can attack with it THIS TURN! Let me check the board again... it shows Renegade Demon 5/3 without \"(sick)\".\n\
\n\
But my lands are tapped... let me cast Disciple of Perdition first since it's only {1}{B}:",
